#. module: stock_location_tracking_restriction
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_location_tracking_restriction.field_stock_location__product_tracking_restriction
msgid ""
"Limit the products that can be put in this location and its sublocations by "
"how they are tracked. A sublocation with its own setting follows that "
"setting instead. Stock already in the location is not affected."
msgstr ""
"このロケーションとその配下のロケーションに入れられるプロダクトを、追跡方法で"
"制限します。配下のロケーションに独自の設定がある場合は、そちらに従います。設"
"定した時点でロケーションにある在庫には影響しません。"

